<title>USA: Federal Reserve business loans rose in Sept 4 week.</title>
<headline>Federal Reserve business loans rose in Sept 4 week.</headline>
<text>
<p>ONE WEEK ended August 28</p>
<p> U.S. business Loans.......359,405 down.....913</p>
<p> Excluding acceptances.....357,779 down.....965</p>
<p> Govt, agency securities...270,990 up.....1,797</p>
